Cell["XMLPattern::bracket: (XMLPattern[\"ul\", \"classList\" -> \"menu\"] | XMLPattern[\"ol\"])[{x:\"li\", ___}] gives constraints to alternatives or a test, not to an XMLPattern. Constraints go in the bracket of each XMLPattern: XMLPattern[\"ul\", \"classList\" -> \"menu\"][{x:\"li\", ___}] | XMLPattern[\"ol\"][{x:\"li\", ___}]. For a pattern from FromCSSSelector[\"selector\"], give them to the selector string instead, as in \"selector\"[c1, c2, ...].", "Message", "MSG"],

